# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to ignore these files since the code is
#   intended to run in multiple environments; otherwise, check them in:
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#1255, lock files should be placed under version control.
#   Only ignore if you want to rely on the platform's packager.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock contains the resolved dependencies and should
#   be placed under version control.
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock contains the resolved dependencies and should
#   be placed under version control.
# pdm.lock

